            "detailed_description": "Desperados 2 is the sequel to the successful wild west title Desperados - Wanted Dead or Alive. The gameplay is based on its predecessor but with brand new tactical possibilities in a beautiful 3D environment. Switch from an isometric view to a third person view whenever you want; for example, for duels, brawls and shoot-outs. The great variety of settings includes dusty canyons, ghost towns, American Indian villages and forts, creating a breathtaking atmosphere. Take on the role of up to six heroes, including the famous bounty hunter John Cooper, and experience  a thrilling story with surprising turns.<br>\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Real-time-strategy and tactics</strong> in an exciting story and a thrilling Western atmosphere<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Varied settings</strong> including towns, American Indian villages, dusty canyons, forts, wagon convoys and ghost towns<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Double 3D view:</strong> pivotable isometric view and 3rd person view for fights and very close action<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Several levels of difficulty and a new A.I</strong>. with more tactical opponent behaviour and more interaction with allies<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Six individual actions per hero and overall 20 new actions</strong>, such as swimming, sedative injection and handcuffs<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>A new hero:</strong> Hawkeyes, the American Indian<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Five actions per hero</strong> planable in advance with headword overview (Quick Actions)<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>More interaction with the environment</strong> due to full 3D interior views of buildings and movements like climbing, sneaking, jumping and hiding</li></ul>",
